# .understandignore - patterns for files/dirs to exclude from analysis
# Syntax: same as .gitignore (globs, # comments, ! negation, trailing / for dirs)
#
# Built-in defaults already exclude common dependency, cache, build, media,
# binary, lock, and generated files.
#
# Project-specific exclusions:
downloads/
graphify-out/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
